# Filament 5 / Livewire 4

- Register UI only via `VcookiebarPlugin::make()` on the panel.
- Forms: `Filament\Forms\Components\*`. Layout: `Filament\Schemas\Components\*`.
- Actions: `Filament\Actions\*` — never `Filament\Tables\Actions\*`.
- Icons: `Filament\Support\Icons\Heroicon`.
- Settings page owns appearance/policy fields; soft-use Voodbuilder link helpers only when classes exist.
- Do not add resources unless product scope expands beyond settings.
